  "question": {
    "text": "A damped harmonic oscillator has a frequency of <math><mn>5</mn></math> oscillations per second. The amplitude drops to half its value for every 10 oscillations. The time it will take to drop to <math><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow></mfrac></math> of the original amplitude is close to:"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>50</mn><mi> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>100</mn><mi> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>20</mn><mi> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mn>10</mn><mi> </mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "C"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<math><mi>f</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>5</mn></math>  <br/>So, <math><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac></math>  <br/>Time taken for amplitude to drop to half: <math><mn>10</mn><mi>T</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>10</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>5</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mn>2</mn></math> s <br/>Now, <br/><math><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><mn>1000</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msub><mrow><mi>A</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow></msub></mrow><mrow><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup></mrow></mfrac></math>  <br/><math><msup><mrow><mo>(</mo><mn>2</mn><mo>)</mo></mrow><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1000</mn></math>  <br/><math><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mi>t</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mn>2</mn><mo>=</mo><mn>3</mn></math>  <br/><math><mi>t</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>6</mn></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>≈</mo><mn>20</mn><mtext> </mtext><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">s</mi></math>"
  }
